In article <1992Mar17.004042.29544@cs.wayne.edu> dfl@math.wayne.edu (David Frohardt-Lane) writes:
[regarding a ring of stealth]
>                  Every time I don't have one and go into a graveyard,
>some monsters always start attacking before I can finish the wraith
>corpses. 

No, what you should do is leave the wraiths for last.  The lower the level
you are, the less experience you need to go up a level.  Chances are that
if you eat the wraiths first and then kill the rest, you will end up with
a smaller net gain than if you kill everything but the wraiths before killing
and eating the wraiths.  Also, kill all the wraiths, then eat all the corpses.
(For the same reasons.)

